1
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,130
Happy birthday!
生日快樂！

2
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,290
Happy birthday!
生日快樂！

3
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,170
Rach, come on.
瑞秋，別這樣

4
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:14,970
It's your birthday!
是你的生日耶！

5
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:16,770
Hey...
嘿…

6
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:21,580
She's not as pretty as she was when she was 29.
她不像她29歲時那麼漂亮

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:27,410
Ms. Greene wants to establish some ground rules before she comes out.
在葛林小姐出來之前 她要先把幾件事說清楚

8
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:30,990
Please don't use the words "old" or "downhill"...
她希望你們不要用到如「老」 或者「走下坡」等字眼…

9
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:33,660
or "They still look pretty damn good."
或是「它們看來還是很棒」

10
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,030
They do.
它們還是

11
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,100
Rachel, come on out.
瑞秋，出來

12
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,230
Monica made breakfast.
摩妮卡做了早餐

13
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:45,840
Chocolate chip pancakes.
巧克力碎片鬆餅

14
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,240
We've got presents.
我們有禮物給你

15
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:52,200
Good ones?
好的禮物？

16
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:56,650
They're all from the list you gave us two weeks ago.
都是兩星期前你給的單子上的

17
00:00:57,250 --> 00:01:00,280
Can I keep the presents and still be 29?
我可以只收禮物 而仍然是29歲嗎？

18
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:04,760
Come on, Rach, turning 30 is not that big a deal.
瑞秋，30歲沒什麼大不了

19
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:07,920
Really? Is that how you felt when you turned 30?
真的？你滿30時也是這麼覺得嗎？

20
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:10,150
Why, God, why?
為什麼，上帝，為什麼？

21
00:01:10,830 --> 00:01:14,360
We had a deal. Let the others grow old, not me!
我們講好的了 讓其他人變老，我不要！

22
00:01:18,010 --> 00:01:20,630
You guys, is it just me? Am I overreacting?
只有我這樣嗎？是我反應過度嗎？

23
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:25,510
No, it's not just you. My 30th birthday sure wasn't much fun.
不，不是只有你 我的30歲生日也不好過

24
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:27,770
And now Chandler!
現在是錢德了！

25
00:01:29,780 --> 00:01:31,680
We're all getting so old.
我們都變得這麼老

26
00:01:31,890 --> 00:01:34,450
Why are You doing this to us?
你為什麼這樣對我們？

27
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:40,790
The One Where They All Turn Thirty
本集播出：步入三十大關

00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:42,790
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

28
00:02:15,969 --> 00:02:17,698
（瑞秋30歲生日快樂）

29
00:02:18,130 --> 00:02:22,760
You're in a great place in your life. You have an amazing job, good friends.
你的生活過得很好 你有很棒的工作，很好的朋友

30
00:02:22,970 --> 00:02:25,130
Your roommate's a soap opera star.
你的室友是連續劇明星

31
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:27,210
Your character is in a coma.
你的角色在昏迷中

32
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:32,410
I promised myself I wouldn't cry at this one.
我答應自己這個生日一定不哭

33
00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:37,540
I know my life's going pretty well, but I see so many people...
我知道我目前過得很好 但我看到一些人…

34
00:02:37,790 --> 00:02:41,120
who've accomplished their goals before they're 30.
在30歲以前 就完成了他們的目標

35
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:44,160
Yeah, but you shouldn't compare yourself to me.
是啊，你不應該和我比

36
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:47,560
-Come on, Phoebe! -You can do it!
-來，菲比！ -你做得到的！

37
00:02:48,530 --> 00:02:50,020
-Come on. -There you go.
-來 -好了

38
00:02:56,540 --> 00:02:59,770
I did it! One mile on a Hippity Hop.
我成功了！在跳跳球上走了一里

39
00:03:00,410 --> 00:03:03,570
That's everything I wanted to do before I was 30.
30歲前我想完成的事

40
00:03:03,850 --> 00:03:06,680
Except I wanted to patch things up with my sister.
除了我想和我妹修好關係

41
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,080
Oh, well. But, yeah!
嗯，可是

42
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:13,750
Girls, this thing is a godsend, if you know what I mean.
女人，這東西是上帝給的禮物 如果你懂我的意思

43
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:26,700
Let's have some fun. What do you want to do?
來做點有趣的事吧，你想做什麼？

44
00:03:26,970 --> 00:03:28,730
Nothing. I don't want to do anything.
什麼也不做，我什麼也不想做

45
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:33,900
Doing nothing on your 30th is better than doing something stupid, like Ross.
在30歲生日時什麼都不做 總比做笨事好，像羅斯一樣

46
00:03:34,780 --> 00:03:36,970
That was a practical purchase.
那是很實際的一項購買

47
00:03:37,210 --> 00:03:39,940
I needed that car for transportation.
我需要那車子做交通工具

48
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:42,580
Okay? I have a child.
好嗎？我有小孩

49
00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:45,310
How hot do I look in this?
我在這車裡看來很拉風吧？

50
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:48,580
Ross, a sports car?
羅斯，一台跑車？

51
00:03:48,860 --> 00:03:52,190
Wouldn't it be cheaper to just stuff a sock down there?
在褲子裡塞襪子不是比較便宜？

52
00:03:53,060 --> 00:03:55,120
That's not what this is about.
這不是為了那個

53
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,630
I am a sports car enthusiast.
我是跑車熱愛者

54
00:03:57,870 --> 00:04:01,560
-I've always been into cars. -What's the horsepower?
-我一直都很喜歡車 -它的馬力多少？

55
00:04:02,070 --> 00:04:04,370
I don't know, but look how shiny!
不知道，你看它多亮呀！

56
00:04:06,770 --> 00:04:10,540
-I can't believe you bought this. -So can I have a ride, stud?
-你竟然買了這台車 -帥哥，載我一程吧？

58
00:04:10,850 --> 00:04:12,210
Hop in.
跳上車

59
00:04:13,550 --> 00:04:17,180
Get ready for the smoothest ride of your life.
準備好你這輩子最穩的一程

60
00:04:41,510 --> 00:04:42,870
Damn it.
可惡

61
00:04:44,850 --> 00:04:46,610
Okay, who's next?
好了，下一個是誰？

62
00:04:49,550 --> 00:04:54,010
I am gonna do something today. I won't sit around like some old lady.
今天我一定要做點什麼 我不要像老太太一樣閒坐在這兒

63
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:56,590
I want to get something pierced.
我要在身上打個洞

64
00:04:56,790 --> 00:05:00,090
Like my nose or my tongue or something.
像是鼻子、舌頭，或是別的地方

65
00:05:00,330 --> 00:05:02,020
Really? Because that hurts.
真的？那會痛的

66
00:05:02,330 --> 00:05:04,090
So what? The way I see it..
那又怎麼？我是這麼想…

67
00:05:04,330 --> 00:05:05,800
Son of a bitch!
該死的！

68
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:10,360
Look, I know what you're going through.
我知道你經歷的

69
00:05:10,570 --> 00:05:13,840
I'm totally freaked out about turning 25.
我25歲生日時嚇壞了

70
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:19,180
Get out of my apartment.
離開我家

71
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:22,670
Rach, I think that you're doing great.
瑞秋，你做的很好

72
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:25,720
Let's face it, no one handles this well.
正視事實吧，沒有人能真的 好好處理這件事

73
00:05:26,090 --> 00:05:27,850
Least of all you.
至少你不行

74
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:36,120
Put that back on. Monica will be here any minute.
放回去，摩妮卡隨時會到家

75
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:38,530
But it hurts my Joey's apple.
可是喬伊的蘋果會痛

76
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:45,770
For the last time, it's not named after each individual man.
告訴你最後一次 它不是以每一個人的名字命名的

77
00:05:49,410 --> 00:05:53,470
You've done a wonderful job with the party. Everything's so lovely.
錢德，你把宴會辦得真好 每樣東西都很美麗

78
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,240
Well, not as lovely as you.
沒有像你這麼美麗

79
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:58,940
I can't believe you have a 30-year-old daughter.
不能相信你有位30歲的女兒

80
00:05:59,150 --> 00:06:02,990
And I can't believe you have a tux that's 30 years old.
不能相信你有件30歲的燕尾服

81
00:06:03,860 --> 00:06:08,390
It's older than that. Ross was conceived right near this tuxedo.
這比30年還老 羅斯是在這件燕尾服旁有的

82
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:13,490
Everybody hide! She's coming.
大家躲起來！我看到她了，她來了

83
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:16,270
Everybody down!
大家蹲下！

84
00:06:22,010 --> 00:06:25,570
Everybody stay here. I'll find out what's going on.
留在這兒，我來看看發生什麼事了

85
00:06:27,620 --> 00:06:30,410
Hey, you got the door open!
嘿，你開門了！

86
00:06:32,190 --> 00:06:34,380
Hey, are you drunk?
嘿，你喝醉了嗎？

87
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:35,820
No.
沒有

88
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,320
Okay.
好

89
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,960
Okay.
好

90
00:06:46,330 --> 00:06:49,670
See, I was a little nervous about turning...
我對要滿30歲…

91
00:06:49,940 --> 00:06:51,300
30.
有點緊張

92
00:06:52,170 --> 00:06:55,300
So the busboys took me out for some drinks.
收碗的小弟帶我去喝酒

93
00:06:58,510 --> 00:07:01,140
Might want to puke on you later.
待會可能會吐在你身上

94
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:07,620
Here's the thing. We've thrown a very formal surprise party for you.
事情是這樣的 我們替你辦了一個驚喜宴會

95
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:10,720
-Your parents and friends are in there. -No!
-你的朋友和父母都在裡面 -不！

96
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,980
-Yes! Yes! -No.
-是的！是的！ -不

97
00:07:12,190 --> 00:07:15,420
Oh, no! My parents have never seen me drunk.
哦，不！我父母從沒看我醉過

98
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:17,160
That they know of.
就他們所知

99
00:07:18,130 --> 00:07:22,330
We'll get you some coffee. They'll never know that you're drunk.
我們替你弄點咖啡 他們不會知道你醉了

100
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:25,030
-You promise? -I'll take care of it.
-你確定？ -我會處理好的

101
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:27,300
I love you so much.
我好愛你

102
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:31,580
Okay, we have to do something about your breath.
好了，要對你的口臭想想辦法

103
00:07:32,510 --> 00:07:34,880
What about your breath?
那你的呢？

104
00:07:35,950 --> 00:07:37,980
That's still yours.
那還是你的口臭

105
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:42,590
Now remember, it's a surprise party.
記住，這是一個驚喜

106
00:07:42,790 --> 00:07:45,120
So when you go in, act surprised.
你進去時要顯得很驚訝

107
00:07:46,530 --> 00:07:47,690
Ready?
好了嗎？

108
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,300
Surprise!
驚喜！

109
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:04,170
Okay, forward. Forward.
好，前進，前進

110
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:05,540
Stop!
停止！

111
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:08,670
Okay, back.. Stop!
好，退後…停！

112
00:08:10,650 --> 00:08:12,020
Okay, for.. Stop!
好，前…停！

113
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:13,810
Stop! Stop!
停！停！

114
00:08:14,990 --> 00:08:17,220
Okay, here's what we're gonna do.
好，我們這麼做

115
00:08:17,490 --> 00:08:20,220
I'll break into this minivan, put it in neutral.
我打開這台休旅車車門 將它放在空檔

116
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:23,260
You push it forward so Ross can get out of the spot.
你們把它向前推，羅斯就能開出來了

117
00:08:24,570 --> 00:08:26,360
All right. Here we go.
好，來吧

118
00:08:32,610 --> 00:08:33,870
Haul ass!
快逃！

119
00:08:45,550 --> 00:08:48,040
Happy 30th birthday! Here.
30歲生日快樂！來

120
00:08:49,190 --> 00:08:52,130
It's for the child in you. And the woman.
給你裡面的孩子，還有女子

121
00:08:52,890 --> 00:08:54,090
Happy 30th!
30歲快樂！

122
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:56,090
Why do you keep saying that?
你為什麼一直這麼說？

123
00:08:56,430 --> 00:08:58,760
Because it's our 30th birthday.
因為這是我們的30歲生日

124
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:02,370
Yeah, no, we're not 30. We're 31. Okay.
不，我們不是30，我們31歲了

125
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,570
Wait.
等一下

126
00:09:06,610 --> 00:09:08,200
Oh, it's you.
哦，是你

127
00:09:08,410 --> 00:09:10,100
Yeah. What?
是，怎麼？

128
00:09:10,310 --> 00:09:12,370
Yeah, we're not 30. We're 31.
對，我們不是30，我們是31

129
00:09:14,050 --> 00:09:16,540
That's what it says on my birth certificate.
我的出生證明上是這麼寫的

130
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:18,310
You have a birth certificate?
你有出生證明？

131
00:09:18,590 --> 00:09:21,450
I got a big box of family stuff when my mom died.
我媽去世時，我拿到了 一箱子家庭文件

132
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,010
Our mom.
我們的媽

133
00:09:23,590 --> 00:09:24,790
Right. Okay.
好，好

134
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:30,620
-Do you have mine? -No, I sold it to a Swedish runaway.
-你有我的嗎？ -沒有，我賣給了一個逃家的瑞典人

135
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:34,800
Oh, my God.
我的老天

136
00:09:35,740 --> 00:09:37,830
Oh, my God, we are 31!
我的老天，我們31了！

137
00:09:38,110 --> 00:09:39,600
Yeah.
是啊

138
00:09:40,610 --> 00:09:43,440
I just lost a whole year of my life.
我失去了整整一年生命

139
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:44,940
Okay.
好

140
00:09:46,410 --> 00:09:48,940
-Your middle name is Pamela? -Yes.
-你的中間名字是潘蜜拉？ -對

141
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:52,180
I never knew mine. Do you remember what it is?
我從不知道我的是什麼 你記得是什麼嗎？

142
00:09:52,390 --> 00:09:53,380
Yes.
記得

143
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:54,540
Phoebe.
是菲比

144
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:59,590
-That's my first name. -Right. Okay. Then, no.
-那是我的正式名字 -對，好吧，那我不知道

145
00:10:03,330 --> 00:10:06,200
We made it across the room. You're doing great.
我們成功地穿過了客廳 你做的很好

146
00:10:06,630 --> 00:10:07,690
What's going on?
怎麼回事？

147
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,490
Monica's a little drunk.
摩妮卡有一點醉了

148
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,830
Yeah! I love drunk Monica.
我喜歡酒醉的摩妮卡

149
00:10:13,370 --> 00:10:16,610
Oh, she's so much more fun than regular Monica.
她比正常的摩妮卡有趣多了

150
00:10:19,810 --> 00:10:21,940
She doesn't want her parents to know.
她不想讓她的父母知道

151
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:25,510
All right, all right. Here's what we'll do.
好，好，我們這麼做

152
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:29,490
I'll get twice as drunk,  then no one will even notice her.
我來比她醉得厲害兩倍 就沒有人會注意她了

153
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:35,530
What's going on?
怎麼了？

154
00:10:36,460 --> 00:10:37,730
Monica's wasted.
摩妮卡醉了

155
00:10:37,930 --> 00:10:40,530
Maybe that'll liven up this party.
或許能讓這個宴會有點生機

156
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,600
Will you just help her get changed?
你能不能幫她換衣服？

157
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:47,270
Taking care of a drunk, naked woman seems like a job for Joey.
照顧酒醉，裸體的女人 好像是喬伊的工作

158
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:54,210
This one's from me.
這是我的禮物

159
00:10:54,450 --> 00:10:57,080
It wasn't on your list,  but it's really fun.
這不在你的禮物單子上 不過它真的很好玩

160
00:10:58,820 --> 00:11:00,480
A scooter.
滑板車

161
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:04,420
Stick to the list.
照著單子買

162
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:09,120
Always stick to the list.
永遠記得照著單子買

163
00:11:09,830 --> 00:11:12,260
No, no, I love it. Thank you.
不，不，我很喜歡，謝謝

164
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:15,260
Open ours next! Open ours next!
下一個開我們的禮物！ 下一個開我們的！

165
00:11:15,470 --> 00:11:17,960
Now that you're a couple,  we don't get two gifts?
你們現在是一對 我們就沒兩個禮物了？

166
00:11:18,210 --> 00:11:21,300
For my last birthday,  you gave me a hug.
我上一個生日，你送我一個擁抱

167
00:11:22,210 --> 00:11:24,300
Read the card! Read the card!
念卡片！念卡片！

168
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:30,450
"Happy birthday, Grandma."
生日快樂，祖母

169
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:35,450
It's better to be over the hill...
開始走下坡總比…

170
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,250
than buried under it.
被埋在坡下要好

171
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:44,420
"All our love, Monica and Chandler." That's funny.
我們愛你，摩妮卡和錢德 好好笑

172
00:11:44,670 --> 00:11:47,030
No, no. That was a joke.
不，不，只是一個玩笑

173
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:50,030
I know, I get it. It's funny.
我知道，我懂了，很好笑

174
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:52,240
Because you're not a grandma.
因為你不是祖母

175
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:55,970
To be a grandma, you have to be married and have children.
做為一個祖母，必須結了婚有小孩

176
00:11:56,180 --> 00:12:00,670
I don't have any of those things. That's why it's so funny.
我全都沒有，所以真的很好笑

177
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,680
I'm just gonna go...
我要…

178
00:12:07,250 --> 00:12:10,050
All you had to do was buy the card.
你只需要買張卡片而己

179
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:21,620
It was stupid to get upset about not having a husband and kids.
為著沒有先生孩子就不高興，是很笨

180
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:24,100
All I really needed was a plan.
我只需要一個計劃

181
00:12:24,570 --> 00:12:26,300
See, I want three kids.
我想生三個小孩

182
00:12:26,570 --> 00:12:31,570
And you want to have them all at the same time and all for your brother.
你要全部同一個時候生 把他們給你弟弟

183
00:12:33,410 --> 00:12:35,110
As I was saying...
我正在說…

184
00:12:35,580 --> 00:12:38,850
I should have the first one by the time I'm 35.
我應該在35歲以前生第一個

185
00:12:39,090 --> 00:12:41,210
Which gives me five years.
這樣我還有五年

186
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:46,090
If I want a kid when I'm 35, I don't have to get pregnant until I'm 34.
如果我35時要生孩子 我34歲時才需要懷孕

187
00:12:46,330 --> 00:12:50,200
Which gives Prada four years to start making maternity clothes.
Prada還有四年時間生產孕婦裝

188
00:12:53,100 --> 00:12:56,930
But I want to be married for a year before I get pregnant.
我想在懷孕之前至少結婚一年

189
00:12:57,140 --> 00:12:59,040
Really? That long?
真的？要那麼久？

190
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:06,850
Look all you want, it's happening.
你愛怎麼看都行，已經在發生了

191
00:13:09,750 --> 00:13:13,850
I don't have to get married until I'm 33. That's three whole years.
我到33歲再結婚就好，我還有3年

192
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:15,350
Wait a minute, though.
不過，等一下

193
00:13:15,620 --> 00:13:19,180
I'll need a year and a half to plan the wedding.
我需要一年半來籌備婚禮

194
00:13:19,460 --> 00:13:22,400
And I'd like to know the guy for a year, year and a half...
我希望能認識這個人一年至一年半…

195
00:13:22,660 --> 00:13:24,820
before we get engaged.
再訂婚

196
00:13:25,770 --> 00:13:30,000
Which means I need to meet the guy by the time I'm 30.
這表示我必須在30歲時認識這個人

197
00:13:31,340 --> 00:13:35,330
Which is fine because you just turned...
沒有問題，因為你才剛剛滿…

198
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:37,310
28!
28！

199
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:40,580
No, Ross. No, it is not fine.
不，羅斯，不，有問題

200
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:44,340
I should already be with the guy I'm gonna marry.
我應該和我要嫁的對象在一起了

201
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:53,350
Will you quit hogging it?
你可不可以不要跳？

202
00:13:58,530 --> 00:14:02,430
I'm telling you, it's like watching Bambi learn how to walk.
我告訴你，這就好像看著斑比學走路

203
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,440
You're drunk.
你醉了

204
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:09,370
Mom and Dad are gonna be mad.
爸和媽會生氣

205
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:13,440
Maybe I'm a little drunk.
也許我有一點醉了

206
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:17,450
Are those crab cakes?
那是蟹餅嗎？

207
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:21,420
I told you to come straight to me when they were ready.
我不是告訴你 蟹餅一出來立刻拿來給我？

208
00:14:23,690 --> 00:14:25,060
How you feeling?
覺得怎麼樣？

209
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:28,690
You are so handsome.
你好帥

210
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:33,960
I want to make love to you right here, right now.
我想在此時此地和你上床

211
00:14:36,740 --> 00:14:39,570
I really wish that you wouldn't.
我希望你不會

212
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:45,970
Just get through a little bit more, then we can put you in bed.
再撐一下，我們就可以帶你去睡覺

213
00:14:46,250 --> 00:14:50,270
Just smile, and don't talk to anyone.
只要微笑，不要說話

214
00:14:50,990 --> 00:14:54,790
Speech, speech! Let's hear from the birthday girl.
演講，演講！壽星演講

215
00:14:55,860 --> 00:14:56,880
Phoebe!
菲比！

216
00:14:57,090 --> 00:14:59,080
See, everybody's looking at me.
看，大家都在看我

217
00:14:59,290 --> 00:15:00,730
The plan's working.
我的計劃很有效

218
00:15:01,930 --> 00:15:04,900
I didn't even have to take off my top yet.
我還沒脫掉上衣呢

219
00:15:05,470 --> 00:15:07,370
Speech. Come on, speech!
演講，演講！

220
00:15:10,970 --> 00:15:14,300
You can't keep your hands off her for one second.
你連離開她一秒鐘都不行

221
00:15:14,580 --> 00:15:16,100
I think it's nice.
很好啊

222
00:15:16,310 --> 00:15:18,280
I think it's necessary.
我必須這樣

223
00:15:26,420 --> 00:15:29,250
I want to thank you all for coming.
我要謝謝大家來到這裡

224
00:15:29,690 --> 00:15:31,420
My family and...
我的家人和…

225
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:32,680
my friends.
我的朋友

226
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:39,490
I'd really like to say that I'm...
我很想說我…

227
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:44,270
You know what I'd really like to say?
知道我真的很想說什麼嗎？

228
00:15:45,010 --> 00:15:46,700
I'm drunk!
我醉了！

229
00:15:49,310 --> 00:15:51,180
That's right, Mom and Dad.
沒錯，爸，媽

230
00:15:51,410 --> 00:15:54,780
Your little old "Harmomica" is hammered.
你們的小口琴醉了

231
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,310
And guess what?
猜猜怎麼著？

232
00:15:58,550 --> 00:16:00,540
I've been drunk before.
我以前也喝醉過

233
00:16:01,420 --> 00:16:03,910
And I've smoked a cigarette.
我抽過煙

234
00:16:07,030 --> 00:16:09,690
It's all okay. It's okay because...
沒關係，沒關係，因為…

235
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:11,830
I turned 30 today.
我今天滿30歲了

236
00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:15,490
And I can do anything I want.
我想做什麼就做什麼

237
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:18,840
Because I am a grownup.
因為我是成年人了

238
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:27,370
Okay, quick. Help me get this off.
好，快，替我脫掉

239
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:32,990
I lost a whole year.
我失去了整整一年

240
00:16:33,190 --> 00:16:35,820
I can't believe it. This is so unfair!
真不能相信，真不公平！

241
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:37,990
Come on, Phoebe, it'll be okay.
菲比，沒有關係的

242
00:16:38,190 --> 00:16:39,490
Will it? Will it?
是嗎？是嗎？

243
00:16:40,830 --> 00:16:43,490
How would you feel if you found out you were 31?
如果你發現你變31歲了 你會怎麼感覺？

244
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:47,530
That's not gonna happen. Because we have a new deal.
不會的，因為我們有個新約定

245
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,960
Plus, it ruined my schedule.
還有，這毀了我的時間表

246
00:16:51,170 --> 00:16:55,200
I haven't done the things I wanted to do before I was 31.
我還沒做那些我31歲前想做的事

247
00:16:55,410 --> 00:16:59,710
-Like what? -Like I haven't met any Portuguese people.
-像什麼？ -像是我還不認識任何葡萄牙人

248
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:02,540
I haven't had the perfect kiss.
我還沒有完美地接吻過

249
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:05,010
And I haven't been to sniper school.
我還沒去上狙擊手學校

250
00:17:07,050 --> 00:17:10,220
Why don't we go and have some birthday cake?
我們去吃蛋糕吧

251
00:17:10,590 --> 00:17:14,690
I just feel like being by myself. See you guys later. Thanks.
我只想一個人靜一下，待會見，謝謝

252
00:17:16,860 --> 00:17:18,230
Poor Phoebe.
可憐的菲比

253
00:17:18,870 --> 00:17:22,390
Hey, you guys, I think I'm gonna walk her home.
嘿，知道嗎？我想我要陪她走回家

254
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:28,370
-Oh, man. -What?
-老天 -怎麼？

255
00:17:28,610 --> 00:17:30,600
He's gonna eat the cake.
他會吃了蛋糕

256
00:17:32,450 --> 00:17:33,810
Phoebe!
菲比！

257
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,610
Listen, I...
聽著，我…

258
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,580
Close your eyes.
閉上眼睛

259
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:53,200
That's one thing to cross off your list.
你可以將這一項從單子上劃掉

260
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:56,770
Oh, yeah.
哦，對了

261
00:17:58,810 --> 00:18:01,570
Plus, I'm one-sixteenth Portuguese.
還有，我是16分之1的葡萄牙人

262
00:18:05,780 --> 00:18:07,870
Okay, is everybody clear?
好，大家都清楚了？

263
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:10,110
We're gonna pick it up...
我們要將它抬起來…

264
00:18:12,220 --> 00:18:13,650
and move it.
然後移動它

265
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:19,320
All we need is teamwork. We're gonna lift the car...
只需要團隊工作 我們要抬起這台車…

266
00:18:20,130 --> 00:18:22,320
and slide it out.
把它滑出來

267
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:26,390
Lift...
抬起來…

268
00:18:26,670 --> 00:18:28,530
and slide.
滑出來

269
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:31,800
-Ross, I really don't think this.. -Lift...
-羅斯，我真的不覺得這… -抬起來…

270
00:18:32,910 --> 00:18:35,170
and slide.
滑出來

271
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:38,000
-Okay, here we go. -All right, everyone.
-好，開始吧 -好，大夥兒

272
00:18:38,250 --> 00:18:39,870
Lift...
抬起來…

273
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,740
and slide.
移出來

274
00:18:49,890 --> 00:18:53,760
-Hey, Joey.. -Come on, Rach, my turn just started.
-嘿，喬伊… -別這樣，瑞秋，才剛輪到我

275
00:18:55,130 --> 00:18:57,220
Actually, I just want to talk to Tag.
其實我是要和泰格說話

276
00:18:57,400 --> 00:19:00,390
Oh, okay. Hey, can I ride this outside?
哦，好，嘿，我可以到外面溜嗎？

277
00:19:00,630 --> 00:19:02,690
Whatever. I'm not your mother.
隨便，我不是你媽

278
00:19:03,700 --> 00:19:05,400
Not in the street!
不要到街上！

279
00:19:09,110 --> 00:19:13,340
-Are you feeling any better? -Yeah, I'm doing okay. I'm...
-有沒有覺得好一點？ -有，我很好，我…

280
00:19:14,750 --> 00:19:16,050
Let's talk.
我們談談

281
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,810
What's up?
什麼事？

282
00:19:20,050 --> 00:19:21,650
Oh, Tag...
泰格…

283
00:19:22,820 --> 00:19:26,320
You're such a great guy. And we have so much fun together.
你真是個好男人，我們在一起很開心

284
00:19:26,530 --> 00:19:27,760
-But I.. -Wait.
-可是我… -等一下

285
00:19:28,730 --> 00:19:30,700
I think I see where you're going.
我想我知道你要做什麼

286
00:19:30,930 --> 00:19:34,630
Before you say anything else,  can I say one more thing?
在你說任何話之前 我可以先說一件事嗎？

287
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:44,510
Well said.
說的好

288
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:50,150
And a good example of the fun I was referring to.
正是我所謂很開心的好例子

289
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:56,510
But I think I'm past the point where I can just have fun.
但我想我已經過了只要開心的時候

290
00:19:56,720 --> 00:20:00,250
Don't do this. This is just because you're turning 30.
瑞秋，不要這樣 這只是因為你30歲了

291
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:01,950
Yeah, it is.
是的

292
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:06,030
But you're just a kid. I mean, you're 25.
而你只是個孩子，你才25歲

293
00:20:06,730 --> 00:20:09,030
-Twenty-four, actually. -Oh, God.
-其實是24歲 -老天

294
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:16,440
You know what I wish? I wish you were six years older.
你知道我希望什麼？ 我希望你比現在大6歲

295
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:21,050
Well, if I'm wishing for stuff,  I wish I was six years younger.
如果是希望的話 其實我希望自己年輕6歲

296
00:20:22,080 --> 00:20:24,850
-Me too. -Yeah. Sorry.
-我也是 -是啊，對不起

297
00:20:33,890 --> 00:20:35,230
Hey, how'd it go?
嘿，談得怎麼樣？

298
00:20:36,730 --> 00:20:41,290
If I only want two kids,  can I keep him for another year?
如果我只要生兩個孩子 我可以再保留他一年嗎？

299
00:20:42,740 --> 00:20:44,570
You did the right thing.
你做的對

300
00:20:49,110 --> 00:20:51,300
I don't like this anymore.
我不喜歡它了

301
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:59,370
Well, here we are. Just a bunch of 30-year-olds.
我們在這兒，一群30歲的人

302
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:04,890
Do you realize in 10 years we're gonna be 40?
你知道再過10年 我們就40歲了？

303
00:21:08,260 --> 00:21:09,790
Why, God?
為什麼，上帝？

304
00:21:10,060 --> 00:21:12,690
Why are you doing this to us?
為什麼這麼對我們？

305
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:24,370
Yes! My baby's finally free.
太好了！我的寶貝終於自由了

306
00:21:24,580 --> 00:21:25,910
All right!
好極了！

307
00:21:26,710 --> 00:21:28,580
Start it up. Let's go!
啟動，我們走！

308
00:21:37,590 --> 00:21:39,120
How hot are we?
我們拉不拉風？

309
00:21:46,930 --> 00:21:48,900
You want to buy a car?
你要買車嗎？

310
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


311
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


